              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Durchmesser 800 mm,</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">einschl. Auflageringe,</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Tiefe bis 1,25m,</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">mit Schachtabdeckung Klasse &#x22;A&#x22;,</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Für einen bis zwei Anschlüsse.</span>
              </p>
